### Package XML file (copy generated at build time)
/pkg_*.xml

### Component non-repo files (copies generated at build/link time)
/component/backend/mcp4j.xml

### Composer
/component/backend/vendor

### Node modules
/node_modules

### Release files
/release/*

### Local build overrides
/build/override.properties

### Other generated files
.DS_Store
/.idea/laravel-idea.xml

### Temporary plan files
/.plans

### Integration test harness (Docker-provisioned, throwaway per run)
/tests/integration/docker/.env
/tests/integration/docker/www
/tests/integration/inbox

### PHPUnit
/.phpunit.result.cache
/.phpunit.cache
